OL,3,GNEWSAArmy medics practise warzone
OL,4,Arescue operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FSoldiers in Essex have been practising
OL,7,Ftheir ability to extract seriously
OL,8,Finjured casualties from the
OL,9,Fbattlefield.
OL,11,FThe training exercise, involving the
OL,12,FBritish Army's 16 Medical Regiment and
OL,13,Fthe Royal Air Force's (RAF) Tactical
OL,14,FMedical Wing, got under way at the
OL,15,FMerville Barracks in Colchester on
OL,16,FTuesday.
OL,18,FAbout 20 medics simulated a warzone
OL,19,Fscenario, where they might have to
OL,20,Ftreat patients and rush them to a UK
OL,21,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
