OL,3,GNEWSAArmy medics practise warzone
OL,4,Arescue operation
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Being able to patch soldiers up and
OL,7,Fget them back into the fight if
OL,8,Fdeployed on large-scale combat
OL,9,Foperations is key," said Maj Ed
OL,10,FTusting, who commands a squadron with
OL,11,Fthe 16 Medical Regiment.
